WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.358
Before turning on the privacy lock, make
sure your device has a passcode.

00:00:05.508 --> 00:00:09.315
Open Settings, then Privacy, and turn on
Require Unlock.

00:00:10.565 --> 00:00:14.552
Ask Again sets how long you can be away
before the app asks you to authenticate.

00:00:15.352 --> 00:00:16.304
We'll keep five minutes here.

00:00:17.604 --> 00:00:19.889
The switches below control details outside
the app.

00:00:20.739 --> 00:00:21.856
Each is separate from the lock.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:27.612
Here we're hiding Live Activity details so
they stay generic even after the phone is
unlocked.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:32.495
Notifications and Lock Screen widgets also
depend on your iPhone settings.

00:00:33.345 --> 00:00:34.759
Check the written guide for those steps.

00:00:35.559 --> 00:00:36.999
These choices stay on this device.
